      <Callout tone="info" title="Tooling Recommendation (v1)">
        <Text>
          Use Prefect as the lightweight orchestration framework for v1 with a local runner first. Pair with Pydantic
          contracts for stage I/O schemas and Typer CLI entrypoints. Keep workflow deterministic where possible and use
          AI only in defined hotspot stages.
        </Text>
      </Callout>

      <Callout tone="warning" title="Framework Scope Note">
        <Text>
          LangGraph/LangFlow style frameworks are useful later if agentic branching expands significantly, but Prefect is
          the preferred lightweight fit for the current contract-driven pilot scope.
        </Text>
      </Callout>

