          ["attribution artifact freshness", "Legal docs updated for latest release candidate inputs", "blocking"],
          ["unresolved legal flags", "Any unresolved legal-risk flag blocks candidate promotion", "blocking"],
        ]}
      />

      <Callout tone="warning" title="IP and Trademark Disclaimer Requirement">
        <Text>
          Include a standard notice that Warcraft, World of Warcraft, Blizzard, and related marks/material are property
          of Blizzard Entertainment and that this project is an independent fan-made addon and tooling effort.
        </Text>
      </Callout>

      <Callout tone="info" title="Facts vs Expression Handling">
        <Text>
          Facts and game events may be used as inputs, but expressive source prose should not be copied into shipped
          output. Preserve factual substance while rewriting language and structure in original concise form.
        </Text>
      </Callout>

